# Third-party notices

This file lists the third-party Rust crates distributed with MikroTik RIF Viewer
and the text of the licences that apply to them. It is generated by cargo-about
from the dependency graph resolved from `Cargo.lock`, including build and
transitive dependencies, and covers every target platform. Crates whose optional
features are not enabled by `Cargo.toml` are not part of the resolved graph and
therefore do not appear here. Do not edit this file by hand.

Regenerate with the pinned tool version (`cargo fetch --locked` first so the
registry sources are cached; `--frozen` forbids network and lockfile changes):

```sh
cargo install cargo-about --locked --version 0.9.2 --features cli
cargo fetch --locked
cargo about generate about.hbs --output-file THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md --fail --frozen
```

